echnological transformations in medicine, such as the introduction of antibiotics or MRI technology?\",\n      \"depth\": \"deep\",\n      \"type\": \"comparative\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What are the most significant barriers preventing widespread adoption of AI in smaller healthcare practices and rural areas?\",\n      \"depth\": \"medium\",\n      \"type\": \"practical\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"How should medical education adapt to prepare the next generation of doctors for working alongside AI systems?\",\n      \"depth\": \"medium\",\n      \"type\": \"practical\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"If AI can develop drugs in years instead of decades, what ethical considerations arise regarding access and pricing of these life-saving treatments?\",\n      \"depth\": \"deep\",\n      \"type\": \"philosophical\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"personalization\": {\n    \"matchedTopics\": [\"ai\", \"healthcare\", \"technology\", \"medicine\"],\n    \"adjustedFor\": \"intermediate expertise\",\n    \"writingStyle\": \"informative with narrative elements\"\n  }\n}"
